      "hints": [
        "Rearrange the period expression for E before inserting the beam dimensions.",
        "All lengths must be in metres and the mass in kilograms."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Square T = 2π√(4Ml³/Ebd³) and rearrange: E = 16π²Ml³/(T²bd³).",
        "Substitute M=0.500 kg, l=0.600 m, T=0.58 s, b=0.0300 m and d=0.00500 m.",
        "E = [16π²(0.500)(0.600)³]/[(0.58)²(0.0300)(0.00500)³] = 1.35×10¹⁰ Pa.",
        "Since 1 GPa=10⁹ Pa, E=13.5 GPa, which rounds to 14 GPa."
      ],
      "checking": {
