      "hints": [
        "Compare the powers of l and T in the rearranged expression for E."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "From E = 16π²Ml³/(T²bd³), E is proportional to l³ and to T⁻².",
        "For powers, percentage uncertainty is multiplied by the magnitude of the power.",
        "Thus l contributes 3 times its percentage uncertainty, while T contributes 2 times its percentage uncertainty.",
        "Because l and T have equal percentage uncertainties, l contributes more."
      ],
